{
  "id": "socPublish000001",
  "name": "SOC-07 Social Media Publishing Workflow",
  "active": false,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## SOC-07 Publishing (keep OFF until Postiz is hosted and tested)\nNeeds soc_config.postiz_base_url and postiz_integrations (platform -> Postiz integration id). One post per run; failures retry 3 times 15 min apart, then status=failed and an error email.",
